# Production Readiness Implementation - Walkthrough

## Overview

Successfully implemented comprehensive production readiness improvements addressing Issues #16-19 for the Ventics AI API. This walkthrough documents all changes made and provides verification guidance.

---

## ✅ Issue #16: Database Schema, Model Validation, and Cascade Behaviors

### Database Schema Improvements

Updated [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/prisma/schema.prisma) with:

#### Cascade Delete/Nullify Rules

| Model | Relationship | Cascade Behavior | Rationale |
|-------|-------------|------------------|-----------|
| [User](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py#44-50) → [GenerationJob](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/schemas.py#49-58) | `onDelete: SetNull` | Preserve generations when user deleted | Data retention for analytics |
| [User](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py#44-50) → [Payment](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/core/exceptions.py#101-114) | `onDelete: Cascade` | Remove payments with user | Clean up financial records |
| [User](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py#44-50) → `Subscription` | `onDelete: Cascade` | Cancel subscriptions | Automatic cleanup |
| [User](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py#44-50) → `Moodboard` | `onDelete: SetNull` | Preserve moodboards | Already implemented |
| [Project](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/services/project_service.py#13-389) → [GenerationJob](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/schemas.py#49-58) | `onDelete: SetNull` | Preserve generations | Allow orphaned generations |
| `Subscription` → [Payment](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/core/exceptions.py#101-114) | `onDelete: SetNull` | Keep payment history | Audit trail |

#### Database Constraints

- **Text Fields**: Added `@db.Text` for long content (prompts, errors, descriptions, items)
- **String Fields**: Added `@db.VarChar(N)` with appropriate lengths
  - `provider`: 20 chars
  - `status`: 20 chars
  - [room_type](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/core/validators.py#65-81), [style_preset](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/core/validators.py#83-99): 50 chars
  - [name](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py#20-27): 100 chars
  - [email](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/api/v1/endpoints/auth.py#33-39): 255 chars

#### Performance Indexes

Added indexes on frequently queried fields:
- [User](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py#44-50): [email](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/api/v1/endpoints/auth.py#33-39)
- [GenerationJob](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/schemas.py#49-58): `userId`, `projectId`, `status`, `createdAt`
- [Payment](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/core/exceptions.py#101-114): `userId`, `payment_reference`, `status`
- `Subscription`: `userId`, `status`
- [Project](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/services/project_service.py#13-389): `userId`, `isActive`
- `Moodboard`: `projectId`, `userId`, `status`
- `EmailSubscriber`: [email](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/api/v1/endpoints/auth.py#33-39), `isActive`

### Model Validation Enhancements

#### Created [validators.py](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/core/validators.py)

Centralized validation utilities:
- **Password Strength**: Validates min length, uppercase, lowercase, digits, special characters
- **Image Dimensions**: Ensures 256-2048 pixel range
- **Room Type**: Validates against allowed list (bedroom, living_room, kitchen, etc.)
- **Style Preset**: Validates against allowed list (minimalist, modern, scandinavian, etc.)
- **Prompt Length**: Max 500 characters

#### Updated [auth_schemas.py](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/auth_schemas.py)

- Password validation with strength requirements
- Name validation (2-100 chars, no special characters)
- Verification code format validation (4-6 digits)
- Credits field with non-negative constraint

#### Updated [schemas.py](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/models/schemas.py)

- Image dimension validation (256-2048 pixels)
- Room type and style preset enum validation
- Prompt length validation (max 500 chars)
- Field constraints with min/max values

