## ✅ Issue #17: Scalability & Optimization Audit

### Performance Improvements

#### Database Query Optimization

**Identified N+1 Query Issues:**
- [get_user_generations](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/api/v1/endpoints/users.py#67-109) in [users.py](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/api/v1/endpoints/users.py) - needs `include` for related data
- Project queries in [project_service.py](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/services/project_service.py) - needs batch loading

**Indexes Added:**
All frequently queried fields now have database indexes for faster lookups.

#### Async Processing

Existing async implementation in [generations_service.py](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/app/services/generations_service.py):
- Uses `asyncio.Semaphore` to limit concurrent Gemini API requests
- Implements retry logic with exponential backoff
- Proper timeout handling

