## 🚀 Next Steps

### 1. Install Dependencies

```bash
cd c:\Users\Main\Downloads\ventics-ai-api-master
pip install python-json-logger
```

### 2. Update Environment Variables

Copy [.env.example](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/.env.example) to review new required variables:

**Critical Updates Needed:**
```bash
# Generate secure JWT secret
JWT_SECRET_KEY=$(openssl rand -hex 32)

# Set allowed origins (your frontend URL)
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://yourdomain.com

# Add webhook secret (from Paystack dashboard)
PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-webhook-secret
```

### 3. Apply Database Migration

The schema has been validated. To apply changes:

```bash
# Review the migration SQL first
prisma migrate dev --name add_cascade_rules_and_constraints --create-only

# Then apply it
prisma migrate deploy
```

### 4. Regenerate Prisma Client

```bash
prisma generate
```

### 5. Test the Application

```bash
# Start the server
uvicorn app.main:app --reload

# Check startup logs for security warnings
# Verify CORS configuration
# Test error responses
# Check structured logging output
```

### 6. Security Checklist

- [ ] Change `JWT_SECRET_KEY` from default
- [ ] Configure `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` with actual frontend URL
- [ ] Add `PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET` for webhook verification
- [ ] Review and rotate all API keys in [.env](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/.env)
- [ ] Test rate limiting on auth endpoints
- [ ] Verify error responses don't expose sensitive data
- [ ] Check logs for sensitive data leakage

